  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Public overload `AddMediator(this IServiceCollection, params Assembly[]?)` that accepts assemblies to scan (previously the overload was private). This allows consumers to call `services.AddMediator(Assembly.GetExecutingAssembly())` from `Program.cs`.\n            - Automatic discovery and registration of `IValidator<T>` implementations when using `AddMediator(Assembly...)`, so validators discovered in scanned assemblies are registered into DI and can be resolved by `ValidationBehavior`.\n            - Documentation: Updated README to show how to register `ValidationBehavior` as an `IPipelineBehavior<TRequest, TResponse>` and to document the `AddMediator(Assembly...)` overload and the automatic validator discovery behavior.",
